{"about_the_game":"<strong>Brazilian Touring Car Classics</strong> brings several &quot;oldies&quot; to Automobilista, featuring some of the cars that have made history in brazilian touring cars through the decades.<br><br>This DLC includes 4 models (Fusca, Gol, Passat, Uno), spread over 4 unique series:<br><br><strong>Copa Classic</strong> - a modern mixed class series from southern Brazil running classic machines; DLC will feature Fusca, Passat, Gol and Uno with the specs these various cars run in the series.<br><br><strong>Copa Fusca </strong>- a modern series from southern Brazil for Fusca (Beetle) enthusiasts.<br><br><strong>Copa Uno</strong> - based on popular 1990s brazilian Formula Uno series, with the street car stripped down to the basics.<br><br><strong>Hot Cars </strong>: brazilian TC series from early 1980s derivative of the previous Divis\u00e3o 3 from 70s, featuring seriously tuned up versions of these classic cars. DLC will feature Fusca, Passat and Gol.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/724720?t=1507320280","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724720/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1507320280","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724720/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1507320280","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724720/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1507320280","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<strong>Brazilian Touring Car Classics</strong> brings several &quot;oldies&quot; to Automobilista, featuring some of the cars that have made history in brazilian touring cars through the decades.<br><br>This DLC includes 4 models (Fusca, Gol, Passat, Uno), spread over 4 unique series:<br><br><strong>Copa Classic</strong> - a modern mixed class series from southern Brazil running classic machines; DLC will feature Fusca, Passat, Gol and Uno with the specs these various cars run in the series.<br><br><strong>Copa Fusca </strong>- a modern series from southern Brazil for Fusca (Beetle) enthusiasts.<br><br><strong>Copa Uno</strong> - based on popular 1990s brazilian Formula Uno series, with the street car stripped down to the basics.<br><br><strong>Hot Cars </strong>: brazilian TC series from early 1980s derivative of the previous Divis\u00e3o 3 from 70s, featuring seriously tuned up versions of these classic cars. DLC will feature Fusca, Passat and Gol.","developers":["Reiza Studios"],"fullgame":{"appid":"431600","name":"Automobilista"},"genres":[{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/724720/header.jpg?t=1507320280","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":256697219,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256697219/movie480.mp4?t=1507320264","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256697219/movie_max.mp4?t=1507320264"},"name":"Release trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256697219/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1507320264","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256697219/movie480.webm?t=1507320264","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256697219/movie_max.webm?t=1507320264"}}],"name":"Automobilista - Brazilian Touring Car Classics","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license